## 📚 What I Learned

### 🐧 What Bash Is
Bash stands for **Bourne Again Shell**.

It is a command-line shell used in Linux and Unix systems to run commands and automate tasks.

### 💻 What a Shell Is
A shell is a program that allows users to interact with the operating system using commands.

### 📜 What a Script Is
A script is a file containing commands that run automatically in sequence.

This helps save time and automate repetitive tasks.

### 🔹 Shebang
Learned the purpose of:

```bash
#!/bin/bash

This tells Linux to use Bash to run the script.

🔹 echo Command

Used echo to print messages to the terminal.

🔹 chmod +x

Learned how to make a script executable.

